5. Conclusion
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The residual libgoprobe.so is an x86_64 ELF shared object with the complete
PT_TLS semantics the 0002 formal run's ELF verification intended to check:

  - a TLS program header (Type "TLS", covering segment 05 -> section .tbss);
  - dynamic FLAGS STATIC_TLS (plus SYMBOLIC BIND_NOW) and FLAGS_1 NOW NODELETE;
